### Open the interactive Swagger UI in your browser:
###   http://localhost:3000/docs

### Get the raw OpenAPI JSON document
GET http://localhost:3000/docs-json

### Create a product (then see it listed and documented in Swagger UI)
POST http://localhost:3000/openapi/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 120
}

### List products
GET http://localhost:3000/openapi/products
